f38ede170b876175e94606eb/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-287/year-0947/part-08/sources/library/songshi-254-hou-yi-shu/source.txt", "note": "《宋史》巻二百五十四，段落 songshi-9c6e46fee832-p057446；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "6703918e-e296-5f0e-92db-166a7fad4c21"}]'::jsonb)
